  "body": "Apologies if this has been discussed elsewhere:\n\nThere's not much documentation, but it looks to me like the Parser is just a way of adding 'readLine' functionality? If so, surely that can be added with a few simple lines of code.\n\nMy feeling is that the Serial API should just be a minimal wrapper around the Serial port. If functionality can be handled in a platform independent way by a bit of JavaScript then it should be done in JS rather than being pushed into the library where there is a chance it may not be implemented as per the spec.\n\nI think extra complexity would also hamper efforts to get the Library adopted by more browser makers.\n\nAnyway - just my 2p.\n",
